OL,3,ALyon tourism office set on fire as tens
OL,4,Aof thousands join major day of protests
OL,5,Aacross France
OL,6,
OL,7,FA group of young people tells the BBC
OL,8,Fthey are "pacifists" who are "just
OL,9,Ftrying to make things change"
OL,11,FIt follows three weeks of student-led
OL,12,Fprotests across the country, with calls
OL,13,Ffor students to be joined by workers'
OL,14,Funions and key figures from the
OL,15,Fso-called "yellow vest" movement
OL,17,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,18,Fappealed for "calm", calling on
OL,19,Fdemonstrators to show "respect for
OL,20,Fpeople and property"
